[13.632, "o", "  p. 7 \u00b7 5.2 Hardware and Schedule \u00b7 abf6f22b8f92a712\r\n"]
[13.632, "o", "  \u201cWe trained our models on one machine with 8 NVIDIA P100 GPUs.\u201d\r\n"]
[13.632, "o", "  p. 8 \u00b7 6.1 Machine Translation \u00b7 b37abe7f7725f407\r\n"]
[13.632, "o", "  \u201cTraining took 3.5 days on 8 P100 GPUs.\u201d\r\n"]
[13.632, "o", "The big model was trained for 3.5 days.\r\n"]
[13.633, "o", "  p. 7 \u00b7 5.2 Hardware and Schedule \u00b7 abf6f22b8f92a712\r\n"]
[13.633, "o", "  \u201cThe big models were trained for 300,000 steps (3.5 days).\u201d\r\n"]
[13.633, "o", "  p. 8 \u00b7 6.1 Machine Translation \u00b7 b37abe7f7725f407\r\n"]
[13.633, "o", "  \u201cTraining took 3.5 days on 8 P100 GPUs.\u201d\r\n"]
